---
import ButtonLink from "../../shared/ButtonLink.astro";
---

<section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-white/5 bg-space-950/20">
  <div class="w-full max-w-6xl px-6 sm:px-10 mx-auto">
    <!-- Encabezado de la Sección -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400">Soluciones de Extremo a Extremo</span>
      <h2 class="font-extrabold text-white mt-2 mb-4 leading-tight">
        ¿Qué servicio necesita tu negocio?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/60 leading-relaxed font-light">
        Ofrecemos un ecosistema de servicios digitales premium enfocados en la velocidad, confiabilidad y diseño excepcional.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grilla de Servicios -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Servicio 1: Asesoría Web -->
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Asesoría Web e Investigación</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Analizamos tu mercado, tu competencia y tu infraestructura actual para diseñar la estrategia tecnológica perfecta adaptada a tus objetivos.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Servicio 2: Diseño y Re-Diseño Web -->
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-fuchsia-500/10 border border-fuchsia-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-fuchsia-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Diseño y Re-Diseño Web</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Creamos interfaces estéticas, intuitivas y responsivas que enamoran a primera vista y optimizan la conversión de tus visitantes en clientes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Servicio 3: Customización y Desarrollo -->
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-cyan-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Customización y Desarrollo</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Programamos código robusto, escalable y adaptado a tus necesidades específicas. Desarrollamos funcionalidades a medida sin limitaciones.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Servicio 4: Posicionamiento SEO -->
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Posicionamiento SEO</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Estructuramos técnicamente tu web y optimizamos el rendimiento de carga para conseguir que tu negocio destaque en las búsquedas de Google.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Servicio 5: Back Office -->
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-fuchsia-500/10 border border-fuchsia-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-fuchsia-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Back Office</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Simplificamos y administramos tus sistemas de gestión interna, bases de datos y flujos operativos para mantener tu plataforma al día.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Servicio 6: Soporte Técnico -->
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-cyan-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Soporte Técnico</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Monitoreo constante y mantenimiento preventivo para solventar cualquier eventualidad técnica de inmediato, garantizando estabilidad absoluta.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Botón hacia planes -->
    <div class="mt-16 flex justify-center">
      <ButtonLink
        href="/planes"
        label="Nuestros Planes"
        btnClasses="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 via-fuchsia-500 to-cyan-500 hover:from-blue-600 hover:via-fuchsia-600 hover:to-cyan-600 text-white rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:scale-102 active:scale-95 duration-300 transition-all font-semibold"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
